  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Code 128 from TIFF is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Code 128 barcode from TIFF in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode Code 128 data message from TIFF file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
